interprocess provides CMake targets:

    find_package(unofficial-interprocess CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::interprocess::interprocess)

The C API is available as <interprocess.h>.
The C++11 RAII wrapper is available as <interprocess.hpp>.

On Windows, IPCPP_SHARED=1 is added automatically by the imported target.
For static builds, the CMake imported target also carries the Rust standard
library's native system link dependencies.
